  "query_preview": "..\n(Tuesday through next Saturday)\nIssued at 1158 PM CST Sat Nov 21 2026\n\nA dry forecast through the latter half of this upcoming week into \nthe start of next weekend with seasonably cooler temperatures \nthrough the end of the week with subfreezing temperatures each \nnight.  GFS solution most aggressive with the Southern High Plains \npinched under the ridge of an Omega blocking pattern through \nThursday although ridging more weak to nearly zonal with the ECMWF \nsolution.  NBM is following the cooler NBM solution.  A dry Pacific-\nbased trough digging through on Friday but not much of a surface \nfront coming through with it.  Saturday may see a brief warming \ntrend with temperatures with more seasonable temperatures with south \nwinds making a brief return before our next cold front passage on \nSaturday night.",
